    "This removes %@'s meals, photos, weights and preferences from this iPhone. Export or save a backup first if you want to keep your records. Other profiles are preserved. Deleting your last profile also disconnects ChatGPT." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
